ls={n['pixels']}, boundary={n['boundary']}\")\n\n# Check the area around the player\nascii_lines = current_frame.ascii.split('\\n')\nprint()\nprint(\"=== Player area (rows 36-42, cols 38-50) ===\")\nfor r in range(36, 43):\n    print(f\"Row {r:2d}: {ascii_lines[r][38:50]}\")\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "Node 142: color=b, pixels=6, boundary=[[37, 39], [40, 39], [39, 38], [38, 38]]\nNode 145: color=Y, pixels=2, boundary=[[38, 40], [39, 40]]\n\n=== Player area (rows 36-42, cols 38-50) ===\nRow 36: BBBBBSSSSSBB\nRow 37: BbBBSSSSSSSS\nRow 38: bbYBSSSSSSSS\nRow 39: bbYBSSSSSSSS\nRow 40: BbBBSSSSSSSS\nRow 41: BBBSSSSSSSSS\nRow 42: SSSSSSSSSSSS", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "THINKING", "content": "The player is now at cols 38-40, rows 37-40. The corridor is at cols 43-47, rows 30-36. The player needs to continue RIGHT to enter the corridor. But the corridor is at rows 30-36, and the player is at rows 37-40. The player needs to move up somehow.\nWait - looking at the ascii, row 36 has \"BBBBBSSSSSBB\" at cols 38-49. The S region at row 36 is cols 43-47 (the corridor). The player is at row 37-40, which is below the corridor.\nLooking at the level layout again:\n- Rows 30-36: corridor at cols 43-47\n- Rows 37-62: bottom room at cols 13-53\nThe player is in the bottom room. To get to the corridor, the player needs to move up. But there's no UP action. Maybe the player automatically follows the sky-blue path?\nLet me try more RIGHT actions to see if the player enters the corridor.", "kind": "reasoning", "inContext": false}, {"label": "TOOL CALL: python", "content": "<tool_call>\n<function=python>\n<parameter=code>\n# Try more RIGHT to navigate through the corridor\naction(['RIGHT', 'RIGHT'])\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "executed: true\naction_num: 7\nlevel: 1\nscore: 0\nreward: 0.0\nstate: NOT_FINISHED\nvalid_actions:\n  - LEFT\n  - RIGHT\n  - MOUSE\n  - ACTION7\nboard_changed: true\ngameplay_changed: true\nno_impact: false\ndone: false\nlevel_completed: false\ngame_over: false\naction_display: RIGHT\nexecuted_actions:\n  - RIGHT\n  - RIGHT\nanimation:\n  action: RIGHT\n  action_num: 7\n  frames: 5\n  unique_frames: 4\n  board_unchanged: false\n  transient_pixels: 41\n  transient_bbox:\n    - 37\n    - 45\n    - 41\n    - 53\nrequested_count: 2\nexecuted_count: 2\nstopped_early: false\nno_impact_source: exact\nrun_elapsed_seconds: 337.42991313199997\ntime_remaining_seconds: 7582.570086868", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}], "hasExactModelContext": false, "requestIndexWithinTurn": null, "messageCount": 0}}}